=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とりまぜる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">混合；混在一起</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">取り戻す</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とりもどす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">取回；夺回；恢复；收复；挽回</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"166736\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たちは、<ruby>失<rp>(</rp><rt>うしな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>った<ruby>時間<rp>(</rp><rt>じかん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>取<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>り<ruby>戻<rp>(</rp><rt>もど</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さなくてはならない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我们必须恢复失去的时间。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">取り寄せる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とりよせる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">订购；邮购；叫人送来；拉近；拽近</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"227085\">お<ruby>取<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>り<ruby>寄<rp>(</rp><rt>よ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>せいたしましょうか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我可以带你来吗?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\" data-id=\"n1:v:とりわけ\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">とりわけ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</spa