-m\">批发商；批发店；批发商人</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"213815\">そうは<ruby>問屋<rp>(</rp><rt>とんや</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がおろさないぞ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">答案者不会被打破。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">トーン</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">音调；语调；色调；格调</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">同</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">どう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"v-m\">同；同一；上述的；同样；同理</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"189143\"><ruby>英語<rp>(</rp><rt>えいご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はドイツ<ruby>語<rp>(</rp><rt>ご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>と<ruby>同<rp>(</rp><rt>どう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>語族<rp>(</rp><rt>ごぞく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>である。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">英语是德语和同语。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">胴</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">どう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">躯干；躯体；身体；腹部；腰部；剑道胸甲；击中胸甲；鼓框；音箱；船体；庄家</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"203598\">ダックスフントは、<ruby>非常<rp>(</rp><rt>ひじょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>長<rp>(</rp><rt>なが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>胴<rp>(</rp><rt>どう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>と<ruby>短<rp>(</rp><rt>みじか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>足<rp>(</rp><rt>あし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をしたドイツ<ruby>犬<rp>(</rp><rt>いぬ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>である。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">德克斯芬特是一只非常长的尾巴和短脚的德国狗。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">同意</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">どうい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">同意；赞成；批准；认可；同一意见；相同观点；同一含义；相同意思</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"196043\">ボブはその<ruby>計画<rp>(</rp><rt>けいかく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>同意<rp>(</rp><rt>どうい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しなかった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">鲍勃不同意这个计划。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">動員</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">どういん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">动员；调动（人员、物资）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">同感</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">どうかん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">同感；同情；同意；赞同</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"142484\"><ruby>税金<rp>(</rp><rt>ぜいきん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>関<rp>(</rp><rt>かん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>するあなたの<ruby>意見<rp>(</rp><rt>いけん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>同感<rp>(</rp><rt>どうかん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我同意你对税收的看法。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">動機</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">どうき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">动机；诱因；母题；主题元素；（音乐）动机</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"230753\">あの<ruby>人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>動機<rp>(</rp><rt>どうき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>信用<rp>(</rp><rt>しんよう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>できなかった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我无法相信他的动机。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">同級</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">どうきゅう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">同年级；同班级</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">同居</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">どうきょ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">同居；共存</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"225869\">キムはケンと<ruby>同居<rp>(</rp><rt>どうきょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>している。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">金正恩和凯恩同居。</span></div></li>"]